                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Republicans chose to shut down the government instead of protecting Americans\u2019 access to affordable health care.\n\nIf Republicans let the tax credits that make health care more affordable expire, 35,000 people on the Central Coast could see their coverage costs skyrocket. https://t.co/bqr14uUMGE",
