                "text": "As our troops are about to miss paychecks, Republicans just gave themselves another week of vacation.\n\nThey don\u2019t want to work across the aisle to reopen the government, protect your health care, and pay our troops.\n\nGuess they just don\u2019t want to work\u2014period.",
