                "text": "Families are being crushed by the high cost of living. Instead of working in a bipartisan way to fix it, Republicans are pushing a partisan spending bill that will significantly raise families' health insurance costs.\n\nMy House Democratic colleagues and I are standing in strong opposition to this terrible bill.",
